    "text": "Sol. <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> - square planar, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> - seesaw, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub></math> - tetrahedral at aluminium, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> - tetrahedral, <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub></math> -planar dimer, <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> -terminal hydrogens in one plane, PhCl-planar molecules, <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> - trigonal planar at carbon, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> - T-shaped, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub></math> - trigonal pyramidal.<br />Here, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>XeF</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ph</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>Cl</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mfenced><mi>CN</mi></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi>ICl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;are planar"
